.TH geectl-remote-list-scmsync-projects 1  "geectl-remote-list-scmsync-projects 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-list\-scmsync\-projects \- List the projects syncing from a git URL prefix
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote list\-scmsync\-projects\fR [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-offset\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIURL_PREFIX\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the projects syncing from a git URL prefix
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR
At most this many projects (default 100)
.TP
\fB\-\-offset\fR \fI<OFFSET>\fR
Skip this many matching projects (default 0)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIURL_PREFIX\fR>
The git URL prefix to list projects for
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
